  "narrative": "English Wikipedia sits just shy of 7.145 million at the end of February 2026, creating a narrow margin. After formal updating with the available evidence, the posterior probability of crossing the threshold by March 1, 2026 is 96%, though the short window means the outcome remains conditional on a rare surge or measurement quirks.",
